Oh, when the [G]saints go marching in,
Oh, when the saints go marching [D7]in,
Oh Lord, I [G]want to [G7]be in that [C]number, [Cm]
When the [G]saints [Em]go [Am]mar[D7]ching [G]in.

Oh, when the [G]sun refuse to shine,
Oh, when the sun refuse to [D7]shine,
Oh Lord, I [G]want to [G7]be in that [C]number, [Cm]
When the [G]saints [Em]go [Am]mar[D7]ching [G]in.

Oh, when the [G]moon turns red with blood,
Oh, when the moon turns red with [D7]blood,
Oh Lord, I [G]want to [G7]be in that [C]number, [Cm]
When the [G]saints [Em]go [Am]mar[D7]ching [G]in.

Oh, when the [G]trumpet sounds its call,
Oh, when the trumpet sounds its [D7]call,
Oh Lord, I [G]want to [G7]be in that [C]number, [Cm]
When the [G]saints [Em]go [Am]mar[D7]ching [G]in.

Oh, when the [G]stars fall from the sky,
Oh, when the stars fall from the [D7]sky,
Oh Lord, I [G]want to [G7]be in that [C]number, [Cm]
When the [G]saints [Em]go [Am]mar[D7]ching [G]in.

Oh, when the [G]saints go marching in,
Oh, when the saints go marching [D7]in,
Oh Lord, I [G]want to [G7]be in that [C]number, [Cm]
When the [G]saints [Em]go [Am]mar[D7]ching [G]in.
